  "content_html": "<h1>warmth</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">25 Nov 2018</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"04665\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open landscape for symbols 2021-01-08 00꞉25 detail\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04665-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04665-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04665-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04665-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1400w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"landscape for symbols 2021-01-08 00꞉25 detail\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1001\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>landscape for symbols 2021-01-08 00꞉25 detail</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nher smile is a heart\nand everyone who knows her feels it\n \nwhen she is sleeping eyes closed\nand I can feel her warm breath\n \nher lips naturally relax into a smile\nthat makes me feel so at peace and in love\n \nand I feel her beautiful heart\nwith every embrace\n \nshe couldn’t possibly know\n(like the sun doesn’t know)\n \nhow it’s warmth keeps us alive\n</pre>\n",
